usage: prepare.py [-h] --baseline-repository BASELINE_REPOSITORY
                  --overlay-repository OVERLAY_REPOSITORY --destination
                  DESTINATION --output OUTPUT --expected-job-commit
                  EXPECTED_JOB_COMMIT --runtime-manifest-sha256
                  RUNTIME_MANIFEST_SHA256

Materialize a fixed baseline and apply exactly the reviewed nineteen-file
overlay.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --baseline-repository BASELINE_REPOSITORY
  --overlay-repository OVERLAY_REPOSITORY
  --destination DESTINATION
  --output OUTPUT
  --expected-job-commit EXPECTED_JOB_COMMIT
  --runtime-manifest-sha256 RUNTIME_MANIFEST_SHA256
